> Are there even any categories of items that can't be golem-ified yet?

No, but some golems are quite arbitrary: Iron, mithril and METAL turn to 
iron golems, rocks, copper, silver, platinum, gemstone to stone golems, 
plastic, wax dragonhide to straw golems, cloth to rope golems. IIRC even 
vegan food can turn into flesh golems.

So if you want new golems, make plastic, wax, mithril, silver, tin or 
bread golems.

